summary: Validate system status after panic test.
description: |+
    The test case is to validate various server status after system is restored from a system panic

    Parameters:
    - TESTARGS
        Fixed types of system panic. System status will be checked opon system panic types.


contact: Kdump QE <kdump-qe-list@redhat.com>
test: chmod a+x ./runtest.sh; ./runtest.sh
framework: shell
duration: 60m
extra-summary: /kernel/kdump/analyse-status
extra-task: /kernel/kdump/analyse-status
